      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "关键点：poll 的 Redis 操作必须原子化；人工介入不释放原 lease 持有的 worker lock 和 resourceLocks；停止默认归档队列，明确废弃才删除。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "关键点：poll 的 Redis 操作必须原子化；人工介入不释放原 lease 持有的 worker lock 和 resourceLocks；停止默认归档队列，明确废弃才删除。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
